const paidCoins = 4;
const coinsLeft = savedCoins - paidCoins;
console.log(coinsLeft);
console.log(savedCoins);
```
Output:
```text
26
30
```
The balance changes, but `savedCoins` stays 30. Editing a `const` line before running again is allowed. Assigning its name a new value during the run causes an error.

